# TypeScript incremental build caches — regenerated by every build.
*.tsbuildinfo

# Core dumps. The kernel writes these into the working directory
# (core_pattern is "core"), which is how 1.6 GB of process memory —
# capable of holding credentials — was once committed from here.
core
